peg/6ZtAo76DA-2BhKGluVAWc2SqJJulF-rnvRwzS70cM0s\"/><figcaption>旅遊安全｜拿酒店房卡後「1常見習慣」很危險！專家分享防盜貼士（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"旅遊安全｜拿酒店房卡後「1常見習慣」很危險！專家分享防盜貼士（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250821/1035174031277690880013729.jpeg/FpwZkS3FDPgK_563XRqdTLTmN1a0sumQ8fxxcPH8cXA\"/><figcaption>旅遊安全｜拿酒店房卡後「1常見習慣」很危險！專家分享防盜貼士（01製圖）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-19T01:26:21.708238+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1548,"images":21,"source":"HK01 中國","fallback":"none"}}